### get link with code
GET http://localhost:5001/abc123


### test valid code
POST  http://localhost:5001/links
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "code": "dev123",
    "url": "https://github.com"
}

### test invalid code

POST http://localhost:5001/links
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "code": "d",
    "url": "https://github.com"
}


